---
title: "A student's connection drops during a call"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: In the call
    lg1: Reconnecting
    lg2: Away
    lg3: Out of the call
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 yellow
  class lg2 tan
  class lg3 orange
  s0: In the call
  s1: Device asleep, seat still held
  s2: Reconnecting
  s3: In the call, your mute not yet sent
  s4: You left (you pressed Leave)
  s5: Device asleep, seat given up
  s6: Connection lost, seat still held
  s7: Reconnecting, your mute not yet sent
  s8: Connection lost, seat given up
  s9: Disconnected (your seat timed out)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the device goes to sleep
  s0 --> s2: the connection drops
  s0 --> s3: you turn your microphone off
  s0 --> s4: you press Leave
  s1 --> s2: the device wakes up
  s1 --> s5: 2 minutes pass and the server gives up your seat
  s2 --> s0: the connection comes back
  s2 --> s1: the device goes to sleep
  s2 --> s6: 60 seconds pass without a connection
  s2 --> s7: you turn your microphone off
  s3 --> s0: the page tells the call your microphone is off
  s3 --> s1: the device goes to sleep
  s3 --> s7: the connection drops
  s3 --> s4: you press Leave
  s5 --> s9: the device wakes up
  s6 --> s8: 2 minutes pass and the server gives up your seat
  s1 --> s7: the device wakes up
  s7 --> s3: the connection comes back
  s7 --> s1: the device goes to sleep
  s7 --> s6: 60 seconds pass without a connection
  class s0 teal
  class s1 tan
  class s2 yellow
  class s3 teal
  class s4 orange
  class s5 tan
  class s6 tan
